<title>USA: Teletouch Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Teletouch Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>TYLER, Texas 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts - Unaudited)</p>
<p>							Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						    Aug 31,	 Aug 31,</p>
<p>							1996	     1995</p>
<p> Net revenues				  $  8,276	$  4,501</p>
<p> Operating loss				   (570)	    (42)</p>
<p> Loss before extraordinary item	   (2,401)	   (724)</p>
<p> Extraordinary item			   (3,568)		 -</p>
<p> Net loss					 (5,969)	   (724)</p>
<p> Loss/share before extraordinary item   (0.47)	   (0.17)</p>
