<p>NOTES: (1) In July 1996, the Company and ProNet, Inc. mutually agreed to terminate a previously announced agreement to merge Teletouch with a subsidiary of ProNet.  The EBITDA for the first quarter of fiscal year 1997 shown above excludes $522,000 of non-recurring costs associated with the ProNet agreement.</p>
<p>Full Company name is Teletouch Communications, Inc</p>
